
.subckt astra_041_cmos_differential_lc_oscillator vdd vtank VSS iref lp lm outp outm
C0 outp VSS 50f
C1 outm VSS 50f
CM lm VSS 100p
CP lp VSS 100p
LM net3 lm 1u
LP net4 lp 1u
M1 lp lm net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M10 outp net1 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M11 outm net0 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M12 outm net0 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 lm lp net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 iref iref VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
M4 net2 iref VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
M5 net1 lp vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=40u
M6 net1 lp VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M7 net0 lm vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=40u
M8 net0 lm VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
